.SH NAME
CSSNumericValue.to \- CSSNumericValue: to() method
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]to()\f[B]\f[R] method of the \f[CR]CSSNumericValue\f[R]
interface converts a numeric value from one unit to another.
.SH SYNTAX
.IP
.EX
to(unit)
.EE
.SS Parameters
.TP
\f[B]unit\f[R]
The unit to which you want to convert.
.SS Return value
